	"tips": "・Dependent visa is for **family members of residents** with valid Japanese residence status\n\n・Allows **spouse and unmarried children** under 20 to live in Japan with the main visa holder\n\n・**Document requirements vary** by relationship type (spouse vs. child) and main visa holder's status\n\n・Dependent status holders can apply for **part-time work permission** with separate application\n\n・Check the latest requirements at the [Immigration Services Agency](https://www.moj.go.jp/isa/)\n\n> ⚠️ **Important:** Dependent status is tied to the main visa holder's status - if their status changes or expires, dependent status is also affected",
